/*!
    \qmlmodule OpcUaManager
    \title OpcUaManager QML Types
    \brief The application-level QML screens and dialogs.

    These are the top-level QML entry points assembled by the application shell.
    Reusable visual controls live in the \l {Base QML Types}{Base} module.
*/

/*!
    \qmlmodule Base
    \title Base QML Types
    \brief Reusable visual controls for the OPC UA manager UI.

    The Base module contains the presentation-only building blocks (address-space
    browser, connection form, menu and status bars, log and trend panels). Base
    components never import C++ modules directly; the application layer binds them
    to the C++ facades through context properties.
*/
